1. Publish the app as a framework-dependent deployment

1.1. Run the following command to publish the app:
dotnet publish -c Release -o publish-fd
cd publish-fd
dotnet MyWebApp.dll

2. Publish as a self-contained deployment

2.1. Run the following command to publish the app as a self-contained deployment for 64-bit Windows:
dotnet publish -c Release -r win-x64 -o publish-scd-win64 --self-contained
cd publish-scd-win64
MyWebApp.exe

2.2. Run the following command to publish the app as a self-contained deployment for 64-bit Linux:
dotnet publish -c Release -r linux-x64 -o publish-scd-linux64 --self-contained
cd publish-scd-linux64
chmod +x MyWebApp
MyWebApp